\title{Polynomial vs exponential}
\date{2026-09-11T11:47:17Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\taxon{Remark}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{There is an insurmountable gulf between polynomial and exponential time. For example, even #{n^{295}} is #{o(1.001^n)}! We usually take this to be the dividing line between “efficient/feasible” and “inefficient/infeasible”. (Of course #{n^{295}} is probably not actually feasible but in practice we don’t see that.)}
